{"slug": "api-gateways", "voice": "bf_emma", "accent": "uk", "sampleRate": 24000, "duration": 298.275, "contentHash": "edc1d55a06a1ba98333292bb14b90c0031b4aef1572f5c6ff6f1fc0b7b91e33b", "blocks": [{"index": 0, "kind": "title", "text": "API Gateways", "start": 0.0, "end": 2.125, "words": [{"text": "API", "start": 0.25, "end": 0.825}, {"text": "Gateways", "start": 0.825, "end": 1.85}]}, {"index": 1, "kind": "summary", "text": "The front door of your system: routing, authentication, rate limiting, and request shaping — and how gateways differ from plain reverse proxies.", "start": 2.125, "end": 11.075, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 2.375, "end": 2.45}, {"text": "front", "start": 2.45, "end": 2.725}, {"text": "door", "start": 2.725, "end": 2.913}, {"text": "of", "start": 2.913, "end": 2.987}, {"text": "your", "start": 2.987, "end": 3.125}, {"text": "system", "start": 3.125, "end": 3.95}, {"text": "routing", "start": 3.95, "end": 4.6}, {"text": "authentication", "start": 4.6, "end": 5.55}, {"text": "rate", "start": 5.55, "end": 5.875}, {"text": "limiting", "start": 5.875, "end": 6.35}, {"text": "and", "start": 6.35, "end": 6.487}, {"text": "request", "start": 6.487, "end": 6.825}, {"text": "shaping", "start": 6.825, "end": 7.65}, {"text": "and", "start": 7.65, "end": 7.838}, {"text": "how", "start": 7.838, "end": 8.0}, {"text": "gateways", "start": 8.0, "end": 8.5}, {"text": "differ", "start": 8.5, "end": 8.825}, {"text": "from", "start": 8.825, "end": 9.0}, {"text": "plain", "start": 9.0, "end": 9.3}, {"text": "reverse", "start": 9.3, "end": 9.7}, {"text": "proxies", "start": 9.7, "end": 10.775}]}, {"index": 2, "kind": "prose", "text": "Why this matters", "start": 11.075, "end": 13.0, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 11.325, "end": 11.55}, {"text": "this", "start": 11.55, "end": 11.75}, {"text": "matters", "start": 11.75, "end": 12.75}]}, {"index": 3, "kind": "prose", "text": "The moment you have more than a couple of services, clients face an annoying question: 