, {"text": "the", "start": 60.287, "end": 60.375}, {"text": "lobby", "start": 60.375, "end": 60.65}, {"text": "chaos", "start": 60.65, "end": 61.625}]}, {"index": 5, "kind": "prose", "text": "Gateway vs. reverse proxy vs. load balancer", "start": 61.925, "end": 65.925, "words": [{"text": "Gateway", "start": 62.175, "end": 62.625}, {"text": "vs", "start": 62.625, "end": 63.05}, {"text": "reverse", "start": 63.05, "end": 63.45}, {"text": "proxy", "start": 63.45, "end": 63.85}, {"text": "vs", "start": 63.85, "end": 64.3}, {"text": "load", "start": 64.3, "end": 64.55}, {"text": "balancer", "start": 64.55, "end": 65.6}]}, {"index": 6, "kind": "prose", "text": "These get conflated constantly, so let's be precise:", "start": 65.925, "end": 69.975, "words": [{"text": "These", "start": 66.175, "end": 66.425}, {"text": "get", "start": 66.425, "end": 66.6}, {"text": "conflated", "start": 66.6, "end": 67.175}, {"text": "constantly", "start": 67.175, "end": 67.925}, {"text": "so", "start": 67.925, "end": 68.225}, {"text": "let's", "start": 68.225, "end": 68.5}, {"text": "be", "start": 68.5, "end": 68.625}, {"text": "precise", "start": 68.625, "end": 69.675}]}, {"index": 7, "kind": "prose", "text": "Load balancer — distributes traffic across instances of the same service. (See Load Balancers.)", "start": 69.975, "end": 76.3, "words": [{"text": "Load", "start": 70.25, "end": 70.475}, {"text": "balancer", "start": 70.475, "end": 71.037}, {"text": "distributes", "start": 71.037, "end": 71.625}, {"text": "traffic", "start": 71.625, "end": 72.037}, {"text": "across", "start": 72.037, "end": 72.35}, {"text": "instances", "start": 72.35, "end": 72.938}, {"text": "of", "start": 72.938, "end": 73.012}, {"text": "the", "start": 73.012, "end": 73.1}, {"text": "same", "start": 73.1, "end": 73.387}, {"text": "service", "start": 73.387, "end": 74.225}, {"text": "See", "start": 74.225, "end": 74.6}, {"text": "Load", "start": 74.6, "end": 74.85}, {"text": "Balancers", "start": 74.85, "end": 76.0}]}, {"index": 8, "kind": "prose", "text": "Reverse proxy — forwards requests to backends, terminates TLS, maybe caches. One step up: it can route by path, but it's fundamentally a traffic cop.", "start": 76.3, "end": 86.25, "words": [{"text": "Reverse", "start": 76.575, "end": 76.95}, {"text": "proxy", "start": 76.95, "end": 77.475}, {"text": "forwards", "start": 77.475, "end": 77.862}, {"text": "requests", "start": 77.862, "end": 78.325}, {"text": "to", "start": 78.325, "end": 78.412}, {"text": "backends", "start": 78.412, "end": 79.0}, {"text": "terminates", "start": 79.0, "end": 79.638}, {"text": "TLS", "start": 79.638, "end": 80.175}, {"text": "maybe", "start": 80.175, "end": 80.5}, {"text": "caches", "start": 80.5, "end": 81.575}, {"text": "One", "start": 81.575, "end": 81.925}, {"text": "step", "start": 81.925, "end": 82.175}, {"text": "up", "start": 82.175, "end": 82.65}, {"text": "it", "start": 82.65, "end": 82.85}, {"text": "can", "start": 82.85, "end": 83.0}, {"text": "route", "start": 83.0, "end": 83.2}, {"text": "by", "start": 83.2, "end": 83.375}, {"text": "path", "start": 83.375, "end": 83.75}, {"text": "but", "start": 83.75, "end": 83.912}, {"text": "it's", "start": 83.912, "end": 84.075}, {"text": "fundamentally", "start": 84.075, "end": 84.737}, {"text": "a", "start": 84.737, "end": 84.8}, {"text": "traffic", "start": 84.8, "end": 85.175}, {"text": "cop", "start": 85.175, "end": 85.95}]}, {"index": 9, "kind": "prose", "text": "API gateway — a reverse proxy with opinions: authentication, rate limiting, request transformation, API composition, and observability, usually configured per-route or per-API. Kong, AWS API Gateway, Apigee, and Envoy-based setups live here.", "start": 86.25, "end": 103.425, "words": [{"text": "API", "start": 86.525, "end": 87.025}, {"text": "gateway", "start": 87.025, "end": 87.5}, {"text": "a", "start": 87.5, "end": 87.625}, {"text": "reverse", "start": 87.625, "end": 88.025}, {"text": "proxy", "start": 88.025, "end": 88.38